__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
.deepeval/
.deepeval_telemetry.txt

# Raw trial rows and traces ARE committed. They are small, and a hosted model cannot be re-run to
# the same output, so they are the only evidence of what each trial did (docs/decisions/decisions.md,
# 2026-10-12). Processed reports are committed too (docs/specs/implementation-spec-v2.md s23).

# Never commit an API key. The key is read from the environment (spec section 6.3); these patterns
# exist so that a local convenience file can never be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
*.key

# uv keeps the resolved environment in .venv; uv.lock IS committed so the environment is pinned.
